    blurb: "Choosing between offers when money isn't the only difference: level and promotion path, team and manager, project and learning, brand, location and hybrid rules, stability and layoffs, visa and relocation, and how to get the information (team calls, talking to engineers, levels.fyi), with a weighted scorecard.",
